<h4 id="mean-number-of-visits-to-a-state">Mean number of visits to a state</h4>
<div class="proposition">
<p>If <math><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo rspace="0">,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we have:</p>

